// =============================================================================
// Virtualization Service - High-Level Virtualization Abstraction
// =============================================================================
// Purpose: Provides a higher-level abstraction over the platform with tenant
// isolation and logical network concepts. This is an abstraction layer above
// the agent-level operations.
//
// Communication: Unary RPC for all operations
//
// Key Concepts:
// - Tenant: Top-level isolation unit (organization equivalent)
// - Port Group: Network segmentation with VLAN, security, QoS, teaming
// - System Services: Special port group types for mgmt, vmotion, iscsi, ft
// - Network: Logical network (maps to OVN logical switch in implementation)
// - VM Attachment: Associate VMs with port groups
// - Agent Status: Monitor agent health
//
// Use Cases: Multi-tenant cloud platforms, logical network abstraction,
// simplified API for higher-level orchestration
// =============================================================================

